    "body": "@domenic I hear that ☹️. I will take it up with ECMA-402, et al. \r\n\r\nAs an alternative, do you think there's a way for us to provide optional elements here, for example via a localizable wrapper? Changing foundational elements is hard, since backwards compatibility with the installed base is rather important. But there is utility (that would be used by specs and applications) if we can provide it as an extension.",
