    "body": "In my opinion no, although others may disagree. I think there are probably fundamental questions here about programming language design (e.g., are exception messages meant to be localizable at all; I haven't seen much work on that in other languages) which we should not preempt by going in a specific direction for the subset of web platform exceptions that use `DOMException`.",
