    "created_at": "2021-09-22T06:35:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-09-22T06:35:04Z",
    "body": "What I'm saying on is that code depends on `message` in similar ways (though to a lesser extent) to `name` so localizing it isn't advisable. If we were to start over we should never have exposed `message` directly to websites, but here we are.\r\n\r\nI suspect `DOMException` has `message` as the first argument to mimic JavaScript `*Error` constructors. I wouldn't really read anything into it.",
